# Editor tooling for this repository comes from the flake's devShell.
# Neovim runs `direnv export` itself (lua/direnv.lua in the config), so its
# language servers and formatters match this file even when the session was
# started by tmux without an interactive shell.
#
# Run `direnv allow` once per machine; direnv refuses to source an .envrc it
# has not been told to trust.
use flake
